---
import { site } from '../data/site.js';
---
<ol class="order__steps">
  <li class="step rv">
    <span class="fig" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
    <div>
      <h3>Send the details</h3>
      <p>Date, headcount, flavor, and every allergy at the table. The allergy field is the one I read first.</p>
    </div>
  </li>
  <li class="step rv rv-d1">
    <span class="fig" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
    <div>
      <h3>We confirm together</h3>
      <p>You'll get a written quote with the exact size, price and pickup window. Nothing is booked until you say yes.</p>
    </div>
  </li>
  <li class="step rv rv-d2">
    <span class="fig" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
    <div>
      <h3>Pickup or local delivery</h3>
      <p>Pick up in Las Vegas, or have it delivered within the {site.serviceArea}.</p>
    </div>
  </li>
</ol>
